<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13369] .NET: Local node info is not updated on client reconnect</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13369</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Ignite._locNode&lt;/tt&gt; field caches local node information, and this cache info is not updated on client reconnect. We should remove cached info on every disconnect.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
